{
  "id": "E419",
  "title": "What To Do First",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-04-11",
  "synopsis": "Now that we can go outside, what is the first thing you want to do?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50419/863b1b8f85d417f904a72361fbe5fb34638daf58.mp3?1585482839",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "想做的第一件事\n\n丽丽：前面一个月我们每天都在家。现在我们能出去了。你想做的第一件事是什么？\n小何：第一件事？我想做的太多了！跑步、游泳、打篮球！\n丽丽：你知道我想做的第一件事是什么吗？\n小何：是什么？喝奶茶？\n丽丽：不是。我想现在就回学校拿我的书，赶紧准备我的考试。",
    "traditional": "想做的第一件事\n\n麗麗：前面一個月我們每天都在家。現在我們能出去了。你想做的第一件事是什麼？\n小何：第一件事？我想做的太多了！跑步、游泳、打籃球！\n麗麗：你知道我想做的第一件事是什麼嗎？\n小何：是什麼？喝奶茶？\n麗麗：不是。我想現在就回學校拿我的書，趕緊準備我的考試。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The first thing you want to do"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：前面一个月我们每天都在家。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：前面一個月我們每天都在家。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì qián miàn yí ge yuè wǒ men měi tiān dōu zài jiā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "现在我们能出去了。你想做的第一件事是什么？",
      "traditional": "現在我們能出去了。你想做的第一件事是什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài wǒ men néng chū qù le nǐ xiǎng zuò de dì yī jiàn shì shì shén me",
      "english": "Lili: We have been at home every day for the past month."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Now we can go outside. What is the first thing you want to do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小何：第一件事？我想做的太多了！跑步、游泳、打篮球！",
      "traditional": "小何：第一件事？我想做的太多了！跑步、游泳、打籃球！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé dì yī jiàn shì wǒ xiǎng zuò de tài duō le pǎo bù yóu yǒng dǎ lán qiú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: The first thing? The things I want to do are too many! Run, swim, and play basketball!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你知道我想做的第一件事是什么吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你知道我想做的第一件事是什麼嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ zhī dào wǒ xiǎng zuò de dì yī jiàn shì shì shén me ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Do you know what the first thing I want to do is?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小何：是什么？喝奶茶？",
      "traditional": "小何：是什麼？喝奶茶？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé shì shén me hē nǎi chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: What is it? Drink milk tea?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "丽丽：不是。我想现在就回学校拿我的书，赶紧准备我的考试。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：不是。我想現在就回學校拿我的書，趕緊準備我的考試。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bú shì wǒ xiǎng xiàn zài jiù huí xué xiào ná wǒ de shū gǎn jǐn zhǔn bèi wǒ de kǎo shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: No. I want to go back to school now and get my books, and hurry to prepare for my exam."
    }
  ],
